    "passage": "To: ALL STAFF\nSubject: Recycling Campaign\nDate: July 1,2007\n......................................................................................\n\nIn an on-going, earth-friendly effort to recycle more waste for a better environment,\nrecycling now has been made easier to you. We hope to achieve an average of 5\nfewer bags of waste per day.\n\nWe have placed a recycling bin for paper besides all printers. In the pantry and\ncanteen areas, waste collection bins are provided for soft drink cans, glass bottles of\nall types and colors, plastic materials, and waste paper.\n\nThe waste collection bins will be cleared once a day every night. In the event\nthat the bins are filled up in the day, please inform our janitors for assistance. We\nappreciate your co-operation and understanding.",
